WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:07.170
Dad, Mom... I'm scared to sleep alone.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.610
Dad, Mom? I woke up. Read me another book.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:23.830
We have to kill him... And I'll go along with him...

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.090
Not you.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.470
B-But...

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.310
It's my fault.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.480
It's because a commoner like me dared to love a man of your noble blood.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:35.840
It must be some punishment...

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.210
Please, don't say such things.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:40.510
As long as I have you two at my side, I don't need anything.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.250
Come, hand it over.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.310
We'll get killed anyway, won't we?

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:48.250
I know we will, if they find out he's an Alpha Stigma bearer.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.290
And one day, he'll go out of control.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.090
If it has to be that way, I would far sooner...

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.750
Sorry, I guess we woke you. Come here.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.370
This child won't be killed. You won't be killed, either.

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:14.510
I'll protect you both, whatever it takes.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.750
It'll be all right.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:20.010
Surely... surely... surely...

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:23.540
Dad? Mom?

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.310
Contract. Destroy.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.900
Destroy.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.990
Stop it!

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.040
Stop it! Anyone!

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.030
Destroy.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:45.330
I'm scared! I'm scared... Dad, Mom!

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.040
Dad! Mom!

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.510
Dad... Mo...

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:00.430
Ryner.

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:04.890
Sion. Ferris!

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.520
No...

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:13.070
Why? I hate this... All of this...

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.660
The hell was that? Ugh.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:35.930
That made it seem like I was wanted when I was born.

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:38.560
Having real parents who cared about me...

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:43.930
<i>What manner of unfulfillable dreams has such a hideous monster seen?</i>

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.150
You should know as much already.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:51.460
You can't grasp anything with those blood-stained monster's hands of yours.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:53.270
You can't reach anywhere.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:59.470
"If the Alpha Stigma bearer, Ryner Lute, goes out of control outside the country,

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:03.680
or behaves in a manner implying treason against Roland,

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.450
eliminate him immediately."

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.150
I didn't have to be told to know it.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:15.230
That I can't be at Sion or Ferris's side... Or anyone else's, for that matter.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.170
I knew it from the start.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.810
Claugh has? Don't tell me he's...

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:05.000
He barely made it out alive, and he sustained very serious injuries, I'm told.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.960
Field Marshal Klom...

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.550
We set out immediately.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:09.410
Sir!

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:11.280
Your Majesty!

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:23.820
Was it you who sent the message, Major General Calne Kaiwel?

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.460
Yes. You're Corporal Lear Rinkal?

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.210
Yes, sir.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.230
I'm Eslina Folkal, Mister Calne's private secretary.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:35.220
I was also hoping for a chance to ask you about something.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:37.280
Then please, by all means.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.790
Sergeant Luke Stokkart of the Taboo Breaker Pursuit Squadron

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:43.860
and Lieutenant Junior Grade Milk Callaud

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.950
have not been seen since the day before yesterday.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:51.110
It seems as though higher-ups are involved. We can't find any traces of them.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.740
Perhaps you might know something about it?

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:58.560
No, nothing concerning that. But...

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:02.380
Disappearing acts sure seem to be all the rage these days.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.400
Huh?

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.300
Actually, the one you all were pursuing, Ryner Lute, has disappeared.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:12.930
I was hoping you all might have some information related to that.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:18.060
He's been confirmed to be headed towards Estabul territory by himself.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:22.420
I see. That should give us a good idea of his general location.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:26.770
That's a big help. Eslina, go let Miss Ferris know immediately.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:27.940
Right!

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:33.000
Still, Ryner Lute and two members of the Taboo Breaker Pursuit Squadron...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.710
Why are there so many disappearances?

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.960
Sister!

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:45.480
I bought you a bunch of dumplings!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:51.660
It's the Wynnit dumpling shop economy set! Isn't Iris great?

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.610
Yeah.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:56.030
We've searched every place where the wild beast might go!

00:06:56.030 --> 00:07:00.050
All we have to do now is let the underlings handle the rest, and it'll be fine!

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:02.290
Guess you're right.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.190
I'll make you some tea. Hold on, okay?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.290
Why?

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:24.280
Why does my chest hurt?

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.040
What do you need, Brother?

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.000
How long have you been watching?

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.770
Always.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:35.310
Ever since you were a child,

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:38.250
I've always been watching you.

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.050
Brother.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:40.940
What is it?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.180
What did you do to Ryner?

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:48.280
I merely warned him that I wouldn't want him to make any passes at my younger sister.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.580
There's an expression I haven't seen before.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:55.280
You've gained yet another new emotion, haven't you?

00:07:55.860 --> 00:08:02.000
Watching my beloved sister gradually grow gladdens me, yet makes me feel lonely.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.710
Wondering if one day, she'll go off to a place far beyond reach.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.290
Brother...

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:09.630
A visitor.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.470
Miss Ferris! We've learned where Ryner Lute is!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.970
Where did that fool go?

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.390
Estabul territory.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:31.110
Ryner, I'll make you regret breaking your promise with me so badly it'll kill you!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:46.170
Aw, c'mon, don't cry. It's not like I'm dead or anything.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.750
Of course you're not! I would never forgive you if you died!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.550
I'm truly glad you're alive.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:57.590
It was him. The guy who wiped out my old squad defeated me yet again.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.430
The Alpha Stigma bearer?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.180
Yeah... that monster.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.280
Next time we meet, mark my words, I'll kill him!

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.100
Field Marshal Klom!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:14.730
Your Majesty...

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:15.970
Let us go.

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:21.110
How do you intend to handle that monster? Even Field Marshal Klom couldn't...

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:23.870
The soldiers are restless, too.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:28.370
It'll be all right. I have a plan. I'll take up the vanguard.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:33.880
As long as Roland has me, Sion Astal, no monsters shall have their way!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:38.330
Everyone, after me!

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.130
Lord Astal!

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:43.320
As long as Lord Sion Astal is at our side!

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:45.890
Yeah!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.510
What do I do now?

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.500
Are you on a trip?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.420
Yeah, I guess.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:08.330
This area has lots of hot springs and delicious foods, you know!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.140
Yeah?

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.450
There are lots of new stores opening up, too!

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:15.340
It's all thanks to Lord Sion Astal!

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:20.510
And with how peaceful it's become, there are more and more travelers like you.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.930
Truly, our gracious Lord Astal gives us much!

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:26.810
Hey, you haven't touched your meal!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.090
You're young. You have to eat more!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.980
I'll heat that soup back up for you. Hold on just a minute.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:40.070
Thanks to Lord Astal, huh?

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:49.320
Ferris?

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.250
I've finally found you, Ryner.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.870
You'd better be ready!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.630
Hey, hold on, this isn't the place!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:56.710
Let's talk this out!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.350
Enough talk!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.880
Wait, hold on, you're wrecking the place!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:07.760
I had fourteen backpacks full of dumplings ready to go that day!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.430
There's no way one person could carry that many!

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.310
If you knew that, why didn't you come?!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.850
This isn't funny, you know!

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.290
You're soft! Your reactions are sluggish!

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.270
Die, Ryner!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:29.450
Oh, I get it. You must be another elite meant to kill me.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.450
What do you mean by that?

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.750
What's the big idea, wrecking the whole place like this?

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.350
Do you have the money to pay for this?

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.380
I hardly came here to discuss such things.

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:45.880
I'm an elite meant to kill you? What do you mean by that?

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.560
What do you mean, I'm an elite meant to kill you?!

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:56.940
Sorry, I was mistaken. Forget about it.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:59.520
You think that answer would satisfy me?

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:03.320
I know better than anyone that you wouldn't kill me.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.430
What did Lucile tell you?

00:12:09.430 --> 00:12:10.720
Nothing.

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:12.010
What did he tell you?

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:14.910
Geez, you're pushy. He didn't tell me anything.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.650
Lucile told me he warned you not to make a pass at his younger sister.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.610
He's quite the caring brother, huh?

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:24.690
Did you run away because my brother warned you?

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.310
No, it was nothing like that.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:31.050
Attacking women and children night after night,

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.810
faced with desperate pleas from hundreds of billions of parents,

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.750
"P-Please, enough! Not my daughter..."

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.060
You callously respond,

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:40.560
"Mwahahaha, who could stop me?!

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:45.050
I am the terrifying, perverted overlord Ryner Lute!

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.060
All women and children should prostrate themselves before me!"

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.800
You push the limits of human decency.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:52.310
Then suddenly, you turn tail and flee in disgrace,

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:54.070
just because of one little warning from my brother?

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:56.660
Have you no pride as an overlord?!

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.290
Who are you calling "overlord"?!

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.930
Found you!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:18.560
I've finally found you! So this is where we meet.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.920
He's...

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:24.490
Everything Lafra said was right.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:27.150
It's one of you two. I'll figure out which one.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:43.200
You two have sharp eyes. It's hard to believe you're human.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:47.360
You're the one moving in a way that's inhuman.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.970
Oh? Do I look human to you?

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.730
Huh?

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:53.890
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.350
How delicious this looks!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.020
I think I'll dig right in.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.820
Oh, this is fantastic!

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.550
An Alpha Stigma, is it?

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:15.280
Who...?

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.970
I am Tiir Rumibul.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:21.990
I am a bearer of the Divine Eyes, Iino Doue.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:24.120
I've come for you.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.380
Come for me?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:29.760
My friend learned of you in a dream.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:33.820
Of your heart, wounded by humans, crying.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:38.810
My body has been pierced by an arrow?

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:44.400
How low can humans stoop...?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.610
Come!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.530
Hold your fire!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.530
Sion?

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.390
Get back, Ryner!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.280
Ryner.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.200
He came?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:04.160
We're going in to confirm whether the monster is dead or not!

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.810
Don't. Stick to arrows when fighting him.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.840
You won't escape.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.720
Fire!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:19.770
Damn you!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.360
H-Help me!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:34.130
They're not imbued with magic. They're just regular arrows, aren't they?

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:39.370
Amazing. A correct move. Without any food, I might have died.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.180
He doesn't just absorb magic.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:47.500
He devours people, absorbs them, and can heal his wounds?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:54.130
How nice. Your brain tissue looks dreadfully delicious!

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:55.940
Ready!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.760
I'll ask you once more. Do you have any desire to surrender?

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:02.220
None.

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.770
Then you will end up dead.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:09.110
I can eat you before the arrows reach me.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.230
What clever talk. If you could, why wouldn't you do that immediately?

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:13.770
Because, if I killed you,

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:18.740
my friend the Alpha Stigma bearer over there would surely go out of control.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:21.120
Friend?

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.450
He's an Alpha Stigma bearer?

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:24.630
He's...

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.920
He's also...

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.710
He's another monster!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:35.680
It's an Alpha Stigma bearer!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.570
A monster... He's a monster!

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:40.560
Die, monster!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.390
Silence! Silence!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:55.280
Those are humans. They always act this way.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:59.070
They can never live in harmony with us. You know that, don't you?

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:00.650
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:04.620
Ryner isn't like you. Not like you, a...

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.750
Like me, a what?

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.040
Did you mean to say, not like me, a monster?

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.620
Ryner, is it?

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:19.180
All right, Ryner. Come along with me.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.590
This place doesn't suit you.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.930
Hey, Ryner. There's no need to listen to what he says.

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:30.540
Being scorned as a monster, despised as taboo.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:33.820
Is it truly necessary to remain exposed to such things?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.360
Don't you have something to protect?

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:41.070
Come with me. I have many friends.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:44.570
Fire magic at my eyes.

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:47.980
If you could, I could recover completely.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.960
I could take you and escape this place!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.750
Nonsense! Prepare to fire!

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.140
Ryner will fire.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:18:01.000
None of you know the darkness of our hearts, we who are constantly betrayed.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:02.970
Isn't that right, Ryner?

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:08.680
Neither of you...

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:10.690
Neither of you are to blame.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.820
I liked you both.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.140
I didn't follow you here to hear such words!

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:21.870
I won't cause any more trouble for you.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:26.230
It must be rough, looking after a monster who could go out of control at any moment.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:27.830
Ryner...

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:34.840
That must be why you ordered Luke Stokkart to kill me if the need arose.

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.920
An elite, meant to kill Ryner?

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.220
Ryner, you've got it wrong! That was...

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:47.760
You're a king, I know. You have your responsibilities.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.370
You aren't in the wrong, Sion.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:52.260
Ryner...

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:56.480
So don't give me such a pained look. I'm the one to blame.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.490
I make you suffer this badly just by being here.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.240
You're wrong. You don't!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:06.980
But it's over now, Sion. There's no more need to suffer.

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:08.910
Hey, Ryner!

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:12.020
What I seek is... thunder.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.420
Don't! All troops, fire arrows!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.670
Kill him! Kill that monster!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:23.730
Do it!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:26.950
Izuchi.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.690
Come, let us be off. Our friends are waiting.

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:39.770
Ryner...

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.610
Ryner!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.970
The menace has fled. Victory is ours!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:13.260
Three cheers for Lord Astal!

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:15.330
Three cheers for the Hero King!

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:19.150
King, huh?

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:21.910
Ferris. I...

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:27.690
Ryner was right. You're not to blame.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:31.780
You merely protected that which you're sworn to protect.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.830
Lord Astal exterminated the monster for us!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.760
Truly a Hero King!

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:14.760
Having second thoughts?

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:16.450
No, not really.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:20.140
I never liked this country much, anyway.

00:23:11.540 --> 00:23:12.370
No.

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:19.910
This time I'm on a journey to find a fool and teach him a lesson.

00:23:20.570 --> 00:23:24.920
<i>Look, first of all I hate kids. They're loud and annoying.</i>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:28.430
<i>And communal living? That really sucks.</i>

00:23:28.430 --> 00:23:30.640
<i>What's with all of you, anyway?</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:34.880
<i>I haven't decided to be friends with you guys!</i>
